1
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:42,500
[She's Wild Fire]

2
00:00:43,530 --> 00:00:47,620
[Episode 4: Will You Trust Me?]

3
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:51,480
The 1991 Special Economic Zone
stock market

4
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:53,000
was a wealth-making machine.

5
00:00:52,670 --> 00:00:54,050
[Stock Exchange]

6
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:00,800
Some people got rich overnight,

7
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:02,800
building fortunes out of thin air.

8
00:01:05,450 --> 00:01:07,010
Others jumped in blindly,

9
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:08,960
and lost everything they had.

10
00:01:10,050 --> 00:01:11,800
This is the wave of transformation

11
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:14,200
from a planned economy
to a market economy.

12
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:17,130
It's my only chance to turn things around.

13
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:20,160
My memories from my past life

14
00:01:20,160 --> 00:01:21,960
are my biggest bargaining chip.

15
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:25,120
I didn't expect the 100,000-yuan business
you mentioned

16
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:26,250
to be stock trading.

17
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:29,289
It's not stock trading.

18
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:30,400
It's me

19
00:01:32,080 --> 00:01:33,009
taking you along

20
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:34,460
to make a huge fortune.

21
00:01:37,039 --> 00:01:39,500
Miss Xie really dares
to speak and dream big.

22
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,120
There is a saying:

23
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:44,130
"There are risks in the market.

24
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:46,000
Invest with caution."

25
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:49,800
For others, it's a risk,

26
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:51,920
but for me,

27
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:54,979
it's a business opportunity.

28
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:58,120
After the Southern Tour,

29
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,360
Shencheng will be the place to be.

30
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:01,520
And Shencheng Development Bank
is the local bank.

31
00:02:01,520 --> 00:02:03,480
Its current stock price
is only the starting point.

32
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,760
As its business expands over time

33
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:05,760
and dividends are released,

34
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:08,160
there'll only be
more and more room to grow.

35
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:12,000
I didn't expect Miss Xie
to understand the stock market

36
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,080
so well.

37
00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:17,120
Mr. Chu,

38
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:18,460
do you trust me?

39
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:30,120
I really do trust you.

40
00:02:30,300 --> 00:02:32,500
I'm not in a hurry to get this money back.

41
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:33,200
No.

42
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:35,500
This is a matter of principle for me.

43
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:37,960
Alright then.

44
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:40,000
If we make a profit, I'll give you 20%.

45
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:40,900
If we lose, it's on me.

46
00:02:40,900 --> 00:02:41,340
No.

47
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:43,960
I'll give you 20%.

48
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,760
Today in Shencheng,

49
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:48,040
there are plenty of people
who can come up with 100,000,

50
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:51,160
but I'm the only one
who can turn that 100,000

51
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:52,180
into a million.

52
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:56,480
If we lose,

53
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:58,079
I will bear all the losses.

54
00:03:06,020 --> 00:03:08,360
[Chu Chunsheng's mother, Chu-Lin Jiahong]

55
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:09,480
Sell my shares
in Shencheng Development Bank.

56
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:10,640
If it drops again,
I'll be left with nothing.

57
00:03:10,640 --> 00:03:11,600
Shencheng Development Bank is down again.

58
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:12,640
It's green again.

59
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:14,560
Whoever buys this lousy stock is cursed.

60
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,240
Excuse me.

61
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:17,079
Sorry.

62
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:18,560
Hello.

63
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:20,220
Shencheng Development Bank.

64
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:21,400
1,200 shares.

65
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,880
1,200 shares?

66
00:03:22,880 --> 00:03:24,200
That's 50,000 yuan.

67
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:25,440
Do you know anything about stocks?

68
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:28,040
Shencheng Development Bank
has been falling
for a month straight.

69
00:03:28,040 --> 00:03:29,570
It's falling every day now.

70
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:31,050
You still dare to buy it?

71
00:03:31,050 --> 00:03:33,410
God knows how many got trapped in this!

72
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:35,100
If you throw this 50,000 yuan in,

73
00:03:35,100 --> 00:03:37,230
it will be gone in less than three days.

74
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:38,800
1,200 shares is too much money.

75
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,000
I think 500 shares is about right.

76
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,400
Is this woman crazy?

77
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:50,440
Look.

78
00:03:50,440 --> 00:03:51,280
It dropped again.

79
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:52,200
What did I say?

80
00:03:52,480 --> 00:03:53,880
This is a bottomless pit!

81
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:55,000
Miss.

82
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:56,040
Listen to an old lady's advice.

83
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:57,520
While you haven't lost too much,

84
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,800
sell it quickly.

85
00:03:58,850 --> 00:04:00,120
Otherwise, when the market closes,

86
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:01,980
you won't even have a place to cry.

87
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,460
I'm buying more.

88
00:04:04,460 --> 00:04:05,680
1,200 shares of Shencheng
Development Bank.

89
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:06,080
What?

90
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:06,880
Are you crazy?

91
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,280
You bought even more?

92
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:10,120
Have you not lost enough,

93
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:12,140
or do you want to ruin your family?

94
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:14,160
Breaking financial news.

95
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:14,880
To strongly support

96
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:17,120
financial growth
in the Shencheng Special Economic Zone,

97
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:19,000
the state has officially granted
1 billion RMB

98
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:21,920
in special support funds
to Shencheng Development Bank.

99
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:24,240
The funds will support the expansion
and upgrading of SEZ banks

100
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,560
to serve
the development of private enterprises.

101
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,080
At the same time,
Shencheng Development Bank

102
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:29,440
has formed strategic partnerships
with several Hong Kong conglomerates.

103
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:30,520
Huge good news!

104
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:32,960
Shencheng Development Bank
gets state support

105
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:34,440
to bring in Hong Kong capital
for expansion!

106
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:35,550
Favorable policies

107
00:04:35,550 --> 00:04:36,680
and strong support!

108
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:39,560
It's going up.

109
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,000
Buy!

110
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:41,200
Buy Shencheng Development Bank for me,

111
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:41,960
no matter the price!

112
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:42,680
I'll buy too!

113
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:46,880
I want some too!

114
00:04:46,880 --> 00:04:47,800
Buy Shencheng Development Bank for me,

115
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,040
no matter the price!

116
00:04:51,370 --> 00:04:52,450
This 80,000 yuan

117
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:54,000
is just my stepping stone.

118
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:55,800
It won't be long

119
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:58,240
before I can leverage it into a million,

120
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,200
or even more.

121
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,160
What are you doing here?

122
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:07,280
Waiting for my business partner.

123
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:08,610
I want to buy you dinner.

124
00:05:08,880 --> 00:05:09,480
Sure.

125
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,890
Then I won't stand on ceremony.

126
00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:35,480
Since when did this place

127
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:37,000
start letting people

128
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,200
dressed like that in?

129
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:39,940
Look at how she's dressed.

130
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:42,600
So tacky.

131
00:05:42,670 --> 00:05:43,550
Stop talking.

132
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:45,920
Man.

133
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:47,360
I heard your grandfather

134
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:49,240
wants to set you up with Chunsheng.

135
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:50,390
Have you two gone on a date yet?

136
00:05:50,390 --> 00:05:51,790
Chunsheng is so busy.

137
00:05:51,820 --> 00:05:53,659
How would he have time to date me?

138
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:56,200
Besides, you know what his mother is like.

139
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:58,400
Who could possibly meet her standards?

140
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:00,920
Chunsheng!

141
00:06:02,400 --> 00:06:03,200
Chunsheng!

142
00:06:04,280 --> 00:06:05,080
Chunsheng.

143
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:07,250
Why are you suddenly...

144
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:10,400
I've made plans with an important guest.

145
00:06:10,400 --> 00:06:11,280
Let's talk another day.

146
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:13,800
What guest could be
more important than Man?

147
00:06:21,320 --> 00:06:22,200
Chunsheng.

148
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:26,040
Sister Hong told me last week
you were away on business.

149
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:28,040
Why didn't you tell me you were back?

150
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:29,480
Yes.

151
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:31,140
I was away for two days.

152
00:06:32,159 --> 00:06:34,240
I came back to discuss
an important business deal.

153
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,200
Business?

154
00:06:36,080 --> 00:06:36,800
With her?

155
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:37,600
Yes.

156
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,200
Miss Xie is a very busy person

157
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,760
whom I finally managed to meet.

158
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:42,560
Whether I can have a meal with her

159
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:45,940
determines whether
we can continue working together.

160
00:06:47,960 --> 00:06:49,600
If anyone interrupts us,

161
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:51,520
don't blame me

162
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:53,320
for disregarding our family ties

163
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:55,380
and having my manager escort you out.

164
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:56,960
After all, I wanted to have

165
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:59,200
my own restaurant
reserved exclusively for us.

166
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:01,330
But Miss Xie specifically reminded me

167
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:05,280
not to affect other guests' reservations.

168
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:09,010
That's why you were able
to come in and eat here today.

169
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:10,940
How could it be because of her?

170
00:07:11,490 --> 00:07:12,530
What do you mean?

171
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:13,800
Let's go.

172
00:07:14,760 --> 00:07:16,040
This lady must be

173
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:18,500
Miss Lin from Shencheng Hongji Industries.

174
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:21,240
Your father made his fortune
in the building materials business

175
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:23,760
and has consistently ranked
in the middle of Shencheng's rich list.

176
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:25,000
Good that you know.

177
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,640
Our family has a certain status
in Shencheng.

178
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:27,800
It's just a pity
that your father is now
jumping on the real estate bandwagon,

179
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:29,520
following the trend in real estate.

180
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:31,360
blindly expanding to acquire land.

181
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:33,400
Now that building material prices
are soaring,

182
00:07:33,400 --> 00:07:34,600
your cash flow...

183
00:07:35,159 --> 00:07:36,080
must be

184
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:38,060
getting a bit tight, isn't it?

185
00:07:38,159 --> 00:07:39,000
What do you mean by that?

186
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:39,880
Let's go.

187
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:41,680
Let's go.

188
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:42,640
Why are you pulling me?

189
00:07:42,640 --> 00:07:44,000
This lady

190
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,600
is wearing a Siluo dress.

191
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:47,700
It's still a relatively niche brand,

192
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:49,200
but in the next few years,

193
00:07:49,220 --> 00:07:51,020
its price will definitely soar.

194
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:53,280
If you have a little money to spare,

195
00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:54,720
I'd suggest investing

196
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:56,000
in this brand.

197
00:07:56,400 --> 00:07:59,000
It would be more meaningful
than standing here

198
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:01,160
gossiping with your friends.

199
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:01,880
What are you trying to say,

200
00:08:01,880 --> 00:08:02,280
you...

201
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:03,080
Miss Xie.

202
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,200
Everyone knows that

203
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:06,280
anyone who can dine here with Chunsheng

204
00:08:06,280 --> 00:08:07,360
is no ordinary person.

205
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:08,760
After meeting you today,

206
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:10,960
I truly admire Chunsheng's eye.

207
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:13,650
If we have the chance in the future,

208
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:15,210
I hope we can work together.

209
00:08:26,270 --> 00:08:26,980
Why are you giving her that?

210
00:08:26,980 --> 00:08:27,700
Let's go.

211
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:39,480
Shen Man is very picky.

212
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:43,200
She never takes the initiative
to give someone her business card.

213
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:44,330
You're impressive.

214
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:46,940
What about you?

215
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:50,520
Have you ever taken the initiative
to give someone your card?

216
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,600
She and I are the same kind of people.

217
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:55,120
We never make

218
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:57,220
the first move to invite someone.

219
00:08:58,200 --> 00:09:00,240
Because there are very few people

220
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:07,180
worth taking the initiative for.

221
00:09:31,160 --> 00:09:32,000
Miss Xie,

222
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,440
may I have this dance?

223
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,000
My pleasure.

224
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:55,290
I've only known Miss Xie for a few days,

225
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:58,690
yet she always manages to surprise me.

226
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:02,560
She looks so young,

227
00:10:03,520 --> 00:10:06,320
yet it seems like she's hiding
countless stories.

228
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:07,800
Yes.

229
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:09,800
I'm only 22 now.

230
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:11,690
What I can take control of again

231
00:10:11,800 --> 00:10:13,000
isn't just my career,

232
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:14,210
but love as well.

233
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:17,100
Although you are very beautiful,

234
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:18,240
I would never

235
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:21,170
take advantage
of someone in a vulnerable position.

236
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:24,480
I only care about the patent.

237
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:25,860
Whoever can produce it

238
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,120
will get

239
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,100
my investment.

240
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:32,330
A person like you

241
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:34,660
doesn't deserve to be her father.

242
00:10:40,160 --> 00:10:42,090
Pleasure doing business with you.

243
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:50,000
Then you can get to know me

244
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,440
a little more deeply.

245
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,970
Get to know you more deeply?

246
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:54,280
This time,

247
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:56,440
it's not about business.

248
00:10:58,080 --> 00:11:00,140
Then show me a little more sincerity.

249
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:47,800
It's late. No loitering.

250
00:11:57,160 --> 00:11:58,560
Why are you looking at me?

251
00:12:00,560 --> 00:12:01,520
I'm looking at

252
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:07,040
my man.
